1
00:00:11,350 --> 00:00:15,840
Multiple rocket engines ignite, shooting bright white and pink flames downward.

2
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:21,400
A bright beam of light shoots up from the industrial site.

3
00:00:45,550 --> 00:00:47,200
A caption: Forty years later.

4
00:00:53,950 --> 00:00:58,600
A caption: Simulation ready. Two people work at a cluttered electronics bench.

5
00:01:02,650 --> 00:01:04,040
A caption: Tears of Steel.

6
00:01:09,920 --> 00:01:13,990
A foggy city skyline blends old rooftops with industrial machinery.

7
00:01:14,780 --> 00:01:18,050
A person lies motionless on the floor near two lit candles.

8
00:01:19,380 --> 00:01:22,020
A headline: Roboticist creates killer robots.

9
00:01:22,810 --> 00:01:24,270
The sniper aims his rifle.

10
00:01:25,070 --> 00:01:30,390
A circular scope frames a large, stationary mechanical structure with turrets in the fog.

11
00:01:32,420 --> 00:01:34,300
The sniper peers through the rifle scope.

12
00:01:35,420 --> 00:01:37,140
The airship hovers above the city.

13
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,530
The old man lies prone, eyes closed, while the sniper aims.

14
00:01:42,420 --> 00:01:47,220
A dark, armed airship hovers over red-roofed buildings, emitting smoke and bright light.

15
00:01:52,070 --> 00:01:54,080
The sniper aims his rifle through a scope.

16
00:01:58,950 --> 00:02:03,340
The old man raises his head and gestures, while the sniper aims in the background.

17
00:02:13,250 --> 00:02:14,450
The old man looks down.
